# Line-ending policy: this repo is built and tested from both Linux and
# Windows. Every text file is stored with LF in the repository and checked
# out as LF on every platform, so a working tree is byte-identical no
# matter which OS ran the checkout - no more whole-tree "modified" churn.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts must keep CRLF. Uncomment when the first one lands:
# *.bat text eol=crlf
# *.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binaries: never normalize, never diff as text.
*.png binary